<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hertz started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hertz started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Keith Mullins has started coverage of Hertz Corp with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the car rental company closed Wednesday at 29.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
